"""Episode 15 (Year 1642) polygons, used by world_data_1600 and world_data_1642.
1533 -> 1600: Russia takes Kazan (1552), Astrakhan (1556) and western Siberia (1582-98); Spain holds Mexico, Central America,
the Andes to the Bio-Bio, the Plate and the Philippines; Portuguese Brazil, Angola and Mozambique; Ottoman central Hungary (1541),
Iraq (1534), Cyprus (1571), Yemen (1538-1635), Algeria-Tunisia-Libya; Poland-Lithuania (1569) with Ukraine and Livonia; Swedish
Estonia (1561); Mughals (Akbar) from Kandahar to Bengal and Khandesh; the Dutch Republic; Morocco on the Niger (1591).
1600 -> 1642: Russia to the Sea of Okhotsk (1639); Sweden takes Ingria (1617) and Livonia (1621-29); Poland holds Smolensk (1618-54);
Portugal is independent again (Dec 1640) but loses Malacca (Jan 1641) and Luanda (Aug 1641) to the Dutch; Dutch Brazil (1630-54),
Batavia (1619), Ambon, Banda, Formosa (1624), Galle (1640), New Netherland; English Virginia, Maryland and New England; New France;
New Sweden (1638); Qing in Manchuria and Inner Mongolia (1636); Mughal Ahmadnagar (1636) and Kandahar (1638-49); Ottomans lose Yemen."""
